{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1760,
    "dDurationMs": 6060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "During the Cold War the US and the Soviet Union\nhad to build underground silos to house"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7860,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nuclear missiles that could be launched\nat a few minutes notice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11360,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, one of the technical challenges they had\nto overcome that you might not think of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14280,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is acoustics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16100,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Launching a missile in such a confined silo generates"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19580,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a loud sound, so loud that it would've\nshaken apart the missiles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23440,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before they could even launch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25360,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the walls of the inside of the silo had to be covered"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28880,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in acoustically absorbent tiles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30980,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "very similar to those in the world's quietest room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34900,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But after all of the technical challenges were sorted,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38520,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what I wanted to know was\n'how could they have launched these missiles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42320,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "very quickly, if needed, but also never by accident?'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46880,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I visited one of these Titan missile silos\nin the Arizona desert"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50740,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to find out exactly what it would have taken\nto launch a nuclear missile."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58460,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, Derek this is level 2 of the silo, we are\ndown some 10 meters below the surface now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65000,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67020,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the launch duct."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73620,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "— Wow.\n— And that is Titan II."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76420,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The largest and most powerful missile weapons system\never deployed by the United States."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82520,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what kind of bomb is in there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84080,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is a thermonuclear bomb."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86280,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a 9 megaton weapon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88040,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Compared to Hiroshima?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89880,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, call it 650 times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93620,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An enormously powerful weapon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96200,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what was the idea with it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98100,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The idea behind Titan II was to instill\nenough fear in the mind of the enemy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104520,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to cause them to think twice about launching an attack against us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108520,
    "dDurationMs": 5260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Knowing that 10 meters below the desert in our fortified concrete bunker,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113820,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we could ride out their first strike, and live to retaliate,\nif we're forced to do that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119180,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the consequences for the enemy\nwould be so unspeakably horrible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123420,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that maybe they would prefer not to\nget into it with us in the first place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126960,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the essence of deterrence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129920,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This missile is no longer active,\nbut the launch system is preserved."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134140,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I wanted an insight into how it felt\nto control this incredible power."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139760,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can we go launch one?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142260,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I thought you'd never ask!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148220,
    "dDurationMs": 5580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There were 54 of these silos, each one\nstaffed 24 hours a day, 7 days a week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154960,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ready to launch their missiles on the exclusive order of\nthe President of the United States."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160660,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alright then, have a seat here Commander."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163240,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165140,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, this is the control center, this is where\nthe crew waited to launch the missile."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169240,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And how do we know when we need to launch?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171700,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Speaker beeping]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174840,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On radio: 'Alpha, 2, 3, Charlie, Hotel, Victor'\n(A23CHV)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180540,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, we're going to write down every letter and number\nthat we hear in a form in this notebook."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184600,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to write it down in this notebook."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187040,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We'll compare each other's work.\nIf we agree that we've copied the message correctly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190780,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then we have what's called a 'valid message,'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192880,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and authorization to take our lock off the big red safe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195480,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know your combination, I know mine,\nwe don't know each other,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198120,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so we both have to agree to get inside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200360,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Inside we find authenticator cards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201940,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll give those to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204200,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the secret message, they sent us\na seven-character code word."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207680,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're going to look at the first two letters of\nthe code word, we're going to find the authenticator"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210580,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that has those first two letters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211880,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the card here matches the code word they sent us,\nthen this is a legitimate order to go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217700,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That gives us permission to put in our launch keys.\nI've already put them in for us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220940,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Key right here for you, commander.\nAnd for me there's a key right over here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225020,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The keys are far enough apart that not even\na long-armed guy like me can reach them both."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229140,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The keys must be turned within 2 seconds of each other"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231660,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and held, they're spring loaded,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233760,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so held for 5 seconds to start the launch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236380,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That guarantees that two people\nwill be required to do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239240,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You just can't run back and forth and do it yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241240,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And last but not least, we need\nthe secret unlock code for the missle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245120,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Six little wheels. Each little wheel\nhas 16 letters of the alphabet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251640,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nominally 17 million combinations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254480,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Only one will operate the missile."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256600,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the fail safe that prevents an unauthorized\nor accidental launch of the missle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261640,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So once we have all those things:\nauthentication, keys, code, we're good to go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266740,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "— All set?\n— Let's do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268160,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Give me a countdown, \"3-2-1 Turn keys\",\nwe'll send this thing on it's way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271500,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After you comander."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273500,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "3..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274220,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "2..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275040,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "1..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275900,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Turn keys."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278000,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And hold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280960,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, you may release."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282480,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's all there is to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284160,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The green light turns on. Its says \"Launch enable\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287480,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For all intents and purposes,\nthat should say \"Welcome to World War III\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292280,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because that's pretty much what it boils down to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293900,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you turn the key you are committed.\nThere is no \"Oops\" switch anywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298660,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the batteries come to full power,\nthe missile will transfer to internal power,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302140,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning that it is fully independent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304380,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "About that same time, the silo door starts to slide open."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311500,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It will slide through security radar beams\nand set off the alarm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316380,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That gives us \"Silo Soft\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318440,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Guidance Go\" means the internal guidance computer\nhas full control of the mission."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322220,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a few seconds we'll have main engine start."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326600,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From engine start we will build up thrust."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329300,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pump the hold down bolts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331860,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And off you go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333380,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Into the wild we know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347560,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's it? We just basically just ended life on Earth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352660,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As you know it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364640,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In these silos, the Titan missiles\nhad a terrifying purpose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368360,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But they were also put to much better uses,\nminus their war-head of course."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373300,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, the Voyager spacecraft was launched\ninto space atop a Titan III missile."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378640,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Neil Armstrong took his first\nflight into space atop a Titan II."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382880,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The exact same missile that would have delivered\nnuclear warheads to the Soviet Union."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387900,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the Cold War didn't only bring us this fear\nand potential of mutually assured destruction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394140,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it also made space exploration possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398760,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I want to say thank you to everyone for writing in\nto request that this documentary be played in your area."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404300,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thanks to you, we've managed to get it broadcast\nin Norway, Sweden and the Middle East."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409320,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And details are in the description, so check it out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411760,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For everyone else, the documentray will be\navailable online via our broadcasters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417840,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "though there may be some geo-blocking restrictions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420020,
    "dDurationMs": 6700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I'm pretty confident that anyone who wants to see\nthe documentary will be able to via those means."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426760,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I hope you watch it, I hope you enjoy it.\nIt premiers in just a few days in the US."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431740,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's July 28th:\n10pm Eastern, 9 Central."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436200,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For more details check out links in the description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438620,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I hope you check it out and I really hope you enjoy it. I appreciate so much your support."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443100,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It means everything to me.\nSo again, thanks for watching."
    } ]
  } ]
}
